Rule: single hyphen in file names only.
Rule: no plural segments in code paths (e.g., src/entity/product/, not src/entities/).
Rule: mirror interface layer (each Service has ServiceInterface, etc.).
Rule: branch = master; comments in English only.
Rule: contracts and schemas must be changed via Canon with deprecation policy.